---
description: Decide field-level findings for generateFormats.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Invent alternative formats, sequences, or uses of available resources that preserve essential outcomes. Consider remote participation, moderated alternatives, or resequencing where approved, and disclose changes affecting access, consent, or contractual commitments. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
